{"id":32149466097,"name":"Run api tests","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAHfEHr8Q","head_branch":"fix/DHIS2-21992-analytics-per-table-type-timestamps","head_sha":"0d1bd9e09d37541d48b0f06068d432cf51775775","path":".github/workflows/run-api-tests.yml","run_number":52098,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"feat: add per-table-type analytics update timestamps [DHIS2-21992]","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","workflow_id":5591308,"check_suite_id":87150722905,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAAUSpZ_WQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/32149466097","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/32149466097","pull_requests":[{"id":4305624047,"number":24899,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/pulls/24899","head":{"ref":"fix/DHIS2-21992-analytics-per-table-type-timestamps","sha":"01b494eccab2bcd863b0f5fc59e3cceddfbbe508","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}},"base":{"ref":"master","sha":"7bb0b8654cc2babd0f2c85c6930910df7eb5fd8a","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}}}],"created_at":"2026-08-18T14:37:25Z","updated_at":"2026-08-18T14:49:41Z","run_started_at":"2026-08-18T14:37:25Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/32149466097/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/32149466097/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/87150722905","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/32149466097/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/32149466097/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/32149466097/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"feat: add per-table-type analytics update timestamps [DHIS2-21992]\n\nContinuous analytics writes a single global \"last successful update\"\ntimestamp regardless of which table types a run actually processed. A\nrun using skipTableTypes to skip a type still advances that type's\nshared clock, so a later run treats everything before it as already\nhandled and silently drops any changes made to the skipped type during\nthe gap.\n\nThis is Phase 1 of the fix: additive only, no existing read path is\ntouched. DefaultAnalyticsTableGenerator now additionally stamps one\nsystem settings key per AnalyticsTableType actually processed (for the\nfour types that support a latest partition), alongside the unchanged\nlegacy unconditional writes. System Info surfaces the new per-type\nmaps immediately, alongside the untouched legacy scalar fields.\n\nLive-validated on a local server: a latest-partition run with\nskipAggregate=true left keyLastSuccessfulLatestAnalyticsPartitionUpdate.DATA_VALUE\nand .COMPLETENESS at epoch while .EVENT and\n.TRACKED_ENTITY_INSTANCE_EVENTS advanced normally, with the legacy\nshared key still advancing unconditionally as before.\n\nPhase 2 (switching the read path to actually use these per-type keys,\nwhich is what fixes the bug) is deferred to a separate change, since\nit touches the same files PR #24440 (Doris continuous analytics\nsupport) is modifying.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"0d1bd9e09d37541d48b0f06068d432cf51775775","tree_id":"4b069bf0e435d580c98f9bcdf3c7224036e68526","timestamp":"2026-08-18T14:33:36Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","s